1
00:00:14,504 --> 00:00:19,252
Regarde ! C'est la tour Eiffel !
Look! It's the Eiffel Tower!

2
00:00:23,036 --> 00:00:26,344
Waouh, elle est très grande !
Wow, it's very big!

3
00:00:28,873 --> 00:00:31,725
Asseyons-nous un moment.
Let's sit for a moment.

4
00:00:45,246 --> 00:00:51,074
Bonjour ! Je voudrais du fromage, s'il vous plaît.
Hello! I would like some cheese, please.

5
00:00:52,474 --> 00:00:55,974
Moi, je voudrais des pommes.
I would like some apples.

6
00:01:08,788 --> 00:01:12,480
Un chocolat chaud, s'il vous plaît.
A hot chocolate, please.

7
00:01:12,580 --> 00:01:15,792
Et pour moi, un café.
And for me, a coffee.

8
00:01:17,614 --> 00:01:20,298
Quelle belle soirée !
What a beautiful evening!

9
00:01:21,298 --> 00:01:24,750
Oui, Paris est magnifique.
Yes, Paris is wonderful.
